{
  "_doc": "What tools/endpoint-watch/watch.mjs probes. 'pool' keys get an ordered endpoints list in url-overrides.json (healthy first); the app merges it ahead of its compiled list and only accepts hosts on that vendor's allowlist. 'single' engines are watched and alerted on. 'keyed' hosts are probed with no credentials: an auth error means the API is alive.",
  "probe_text": "hello friend",
  "pool": {
    "google_free": [
